NVIDIA NVRTC -- the CUDA runtime compiler
================================================================================

The package ships NVIDIA's runtime compilation library, which serve loads at
run time to compile its CUDA kernels:

    Windows   nvrtc64_130_0.dll, nvrtc-builtins64_133.dll
              (copied unchanged from the CUDA 13.3 toolkit, bin\x64)
    Linux     libnvrtc.so (the bytes of the toolkit's libnvrtc.so.13, under
              the unversioned name), libnvrtc-builtins.so.13.3

They are NVIDIA's software, unmodified (MANIFEST.json in the package records
each file's sha256), and are NOT covered by the Apache-2.0 grant in LICENSE.
